The project successfully demonstrates the development of an AI-powered application using Python, FastAPI, Streamlit, and the Google Gemini API. The system combines a user-friendly frontend with a reliable backend and AI capabilities to provide efficient and intelligent results.

The project helped in understanding API integration, backend development, frontend design, document processing, and AI-based application development. The implemented system achieves the major objectives defined during the planning stage and provides a practical foundation for further improvements.

In the future, the project can be enhanced by adding more AI features, improving the user interface, supporting additional file formats, improving response accuracy, and deploying the application on a cloud platform. These enhancements can make the system more scalable, efficient, and useful for a wider range of users.
